|General Computer Textfiles
|~ B:0-26
|
|Your one-stop shop for all files of a "computery" nature, that cover how to
|rebuild a piece of computer hardware to do something it was never meant to do,
|or to see someone go really deeply into a computing subject that would cause
|most people to yawn and look for the snack table. Since BBSes were on computers,
|it was natural for people who used BBSes to focus on all aspects of these
|wonderful machines. The evidence of their interest and their experimentation
|resides below.
|
|Of course, nearly ALL textfiles are computer-related in some fashion, and some
|subjects might fit here but fit even better in another section. For example, you
|should most definitely check out the [1]programming and [2]apple sections as
|~ L1:37-51 L2:56-64
|well, as you might not agree with what I decided should go where.
|
|
